C. CNN Models 
 
Our proposed model is inspired by VGG 16 architecture, as shown in Figure 11 . The CNN model should not have many hidden layers, otherwise it affects the speed of our framework. For example, if a virtual keyboard has 40 buttons and hand moves on all buttons in one frame, it must predict all 40 buttons same time, then the frame rate slows down lower than 15 fps. For that reason, we chose a shallow deep learning model. 
